@startuml b-seq-failover
title Вариант B: failover push → SMS с переключением SMS-агрегатора
autonumber
participant "Temporal Server" as t
participant "Delivery Workflow" as wf
participant "SMS Activity Worker" as sw
participant "SMS-агрегатор A" as a
participant "SMS-агрегатор B" as b
actor "Телефон клиента" as phone
participant "Callback Gateway" as cb

note over t, wf : SendPush выполнен, workflow ждёт сигнал,\nтаймер 15 с хранится в Temporal
t -> wf : timer fired (сигнала нет)
wf -> t : schedule SendSms(attemptId)\nretry: backoff 1 с, x2, максимум 5 попыток
t -> sw : activity task (task queue sms)
sw -> a : POST /sms, clientMsgId = attemptId
a --> sw : 503 / таймаут 2 с
note right of sw : circuit breaker A открыт,\nследующий вызов сразу идёт в B
sw -> b : POST /sms, clientMsgId = attemptId
b --> sw : 200 accepted {providerMsgId}
sw --> t : activity completed(provider = B)
t -> wf : workflow task
wf -> t : await signal Delivered, timer 90 с
b -> phone : SMS
b -> cb : DLR DELIVERED {providerMsgId}
cb -> t : SignalWorkflow(id, Delivered(sms))
t -> wf : signal
wf -> t : complete(DELIVERED)
... через несколько секунд ...
cb -> t : SignalWorkflow(id, Delivered(push)), запоздалый ack
t --> cb : NotFound: workflow already completed
note over cb : метрика cross_channel_duplicate + 1,\nновых отправок нет
@enduml
